From: Kareem <264479377+kareemnubani4-beep@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:40:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Port to Hyprland 0.57 and add rolling cube for any
 workspace count

- 0.57 renderer: render context (draw/pass/stage events), HLWorkspace header,
  numbered workspace ids, visible()/setVisible()
- Rolling cube: faces filled relative to the starting workspace, wrapping
  within 1..count, count read from the wp-count runtime file

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
